## . [python-poetry] Python tools=pdm,poe
lint                     Quality        declared exact  safe        .          pdm run lint :: Run all linters
start                    Development    declared exact  safe        .          pdm run start :: Start the Flask development server
test                     Testing        declared exact  safe        .          pdm run test :: Run Python tests
docs                     Build          declared exact  safe        .          pdm run poe docs :: Build the documentation site
serve                    Development    declared exact  safe        .          pdm run poe serve :: Start app:app with Uvicorn and auto-reload
